          "section": "Solve Equations Using the Subtraction and Addition Properties of Equality",
          "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/openstax/osbooks-prealgebra-bundle/main/modules/m82463/index.cnxml",
          "summary_zh": "该节分别陈述等式两边减去同一数、加上同一数仍保持相等，并用这些操作解方程。书稿可据此核对规则；双向等价性仍应由书稿自行写出逆操作论证。",
          "verified": true
        },
        {
          "topic": "除零限制与乘除的区别",
          "section": "Solve Equations using the Division and Multiplication Properties of Equality",
          "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/openstax/osbooks-prealgebra-bundle/main/modules/m82464/index.cnxml",
          "summary_zh": "除法性质明确要求除数非零；乘法性质允许乘同一数并保留等式成立。后者不意味着乘零后仍能逆向恢复原方程。",
          "verified": true
        }
